From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:54:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Enable the Allwinner A733 DisplayPort
 transmitter

The Radxa Cubie A7S puts its DisplayPort output on the USB Type-C
connector. Enable the drivers of the A733 DisplayPort transmitter and
its AUX PHY as modules; the video output 1 clock unit is built by
default on sunxi, and the HPD bridge of the port controller follows the
port controller driver.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on one board with the transmitter and
its AUX PHY built as modules; both loaded and the monitor showed the
picture.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index ab1586d3fc98..d6415055da45 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -1055,6 +1055,7 @@ CONFIG_ROCKCHIP_LVDS=y
 CONFIG_DRM_STM=m
 CONFIG_DRM_STM_LVDS=m
 CONFIG_DRM_SUN4I=m
+CONFIG_DRM_SUN60I_DP=m
 CONFIG_DRM_TEGRA=m
 CONFIG_DRM_TIDSS=m
 CONFIG_DRM_V3D=m
@@ -1766,6 +1767,7 @@ CONFIG_PHY_XGENE=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN4I_USB=y
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_USB2=m
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_COMBO=m
+CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_DP_AUX=m
 CONFIG_PHY_SUN60I_A733_PCIE_COMBO=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_TORRENT=m
 CONFIG_PHY_CADENCE_DPHY=m
